{"seq":13,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T10:19:57.109Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"cd18bbf85870c2d4d8e8e715e7cbea050f5ffe09846e2c1b58240fefcf0eb5e2","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","text":"Here are the Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers in Moss's notes. There are two:\n\n- #4419: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea Ramaswell logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing.\n- #PD-4492: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" dated 5 Oct 2025 (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea submitted it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at the Eau Claire yard (Dock Doors 14-18, 04:00 shift) weren't getting SMS bay assignments from the gatehouse kiosk. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct shift went through cleanly. The notes also had an action item to archive the Eau Claire kiosk logs before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n\nI also checked Moss's other North notes, the 9/14/2025 pipeline digest and the 3/23/2026 renewal check-in. Both mention Quarrendon but don't give any ticket numbers. Moss's Central notes have tickets (#4409, #4412, FR-882), but those are for other accounts.\n\nA few things to watch:\n- The cheat sheet has no date, so I can't tell whether #4419 came before or after #PD-4492.\n- The numbering styles don't match: one is a plain number and the other has a PD- prefix.\n- The cheat sheet warns not to mix QFL up with Quarendon Freightways, which isn't a customer of ours.\n\nOutside Moss's notes, your own 9 Apr renewal debrief notes mention ticket #8841 (carrier portal times out on CSV uploads over 600 rows), in case you want it in the weekly notes too."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03OPU0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
